<title>{5MasterCode</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14949</link>
<description>All the codes for this were calculated by working out offsets, and simply adding them on !  Visually looked for the data table, by looking at the US table, then searching through RAM in the UK version to find it. Easy ! Then just used an offset that was the difference between the start of the UK and US data table, to calculate all the UK codes. Checked 'em and they appear OK. !</description>
